WEBVTT

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:13.530
Two Years Ago

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.780
You cannot beat me.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.760
Because you're the King?

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.070
That's right.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:24.420
Because I'm the King.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.790
Come!  Let's battle.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.330
Junk Warrior, attack!

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.480
The trap card Shadow Spell!

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.660
As long as I have this, 
your monster can't move!

00:00:41.660 --> 00:00:45.130
Finish him, Mad Archfiend!  Bone Splash!

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:56.300
Yusei lost…

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.700
Yusei.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:06.170
In a duel, you can't win just with monsters.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:35.340
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can’t be stopped

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:40.400
That’s deeply engraved into us

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:48.940
So don’t be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.880
Break through even further

00:01:55.240 --> 00:02:00.420
While carrying your beliefs in your heart

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:07.530
There’s always only one truth

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:11.390
So feel the voice of your heart

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:16.200
With your unwavering emotions,

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:22.310
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:57.450
Power Insect Deck!  Trap of the Antlion

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.980
So even the King gets lost in his memories?

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:35.350
I used to live in that garbage dump.

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.870
You are the one chosen by the stars.

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:43.830
You should forget about that dark hell.

00:03:46.320 --> 00:03:48.520
There's no way I can forget.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:52.660
I'm so humiliated about the days I spent 
at Satellite that I can't breathe.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:55.950
That land should be destroyed.

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:57.860
That cannot be done.

00:03:57.860 --> 00:04:01.360
Neo Domino City cannot 
exist without Satellite.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:10.970
Satellite is a world that supports 
the prosperity of the chosen ones.

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:15.010
The people who live there 
are only kept alive so

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:19.010
that they can recycle all 
the garbage we throw away.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:22.830
In an ideal world, no one is useless.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:27.840
The fact that the King used to live in 
Satellite is a test given to you by god.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.500
That is what I believe.

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:32.350
A test.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:40.740
In Neo Domino City's history, the only person who 
succeeded in coming here from Satellite was you, King.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:45.690
That is why you are the 
one chosen by the stars.

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:06.150
Incredible!  That's your best time so far!

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:09.010
You'll be able to get through 
the pipeline easily!

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:10.260
Yeah.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.030
Tonight's finally the night.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.130
I'm going one more time.  Time me.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:27.650
I can't believe the people in the 
City dump this much garbage everyday.

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:31.670
Don't complain.  We need to do this to eat.

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:32.710
Whoa!

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:33.400
Hey!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.940
Be careful!

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.930
I know.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.590
Taka!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.420
Are you okay?

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.410
Ouch...

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.720
Yeah...

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:57.390
Sorry.  You tripped over my leg.

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:02.800
You have long legs, Uryu.  He 
should have been more careful.

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:08.390
I thought I smelled the stench 
of garbage approaching,

00:06:08.390 --> 00:06:10.500
but it turned out to be Satellite people.

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:15.500
So then what's up with the 
markers on your cheeks?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.280
I'll tell you.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.720
Ouch...

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.130
You were beaten up pretty badly.

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:35.290
Uryu was recently sent here after 
causing an incident in the City.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:39.530
He keeps bragging that he's 
originally from the City

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:42.530
and getting into scrapes with 
the people of Satellite.

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:46.580
He just wants to say that 
he's different than us.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:49.880
Hey Yusei, how are things going over there?

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.160
It's going extremely well.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.650
He achieved the best time ever today!

00:06:54.650 --> 00:06:57.200
Hey, well done.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.140
It's all thanks to Rally.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.670
I also have to thank Yusei.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:05.730
Since that incident, Security 
hasn't been chasing after me.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.920
Yusei, I'm making you a promise.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.810
I'll never steal again!

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:18.090
I guess there are reasonable 
people in Security after all.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:22.460
It's a fact that a duelist always 
obeys the outcome of a duel.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.570
I wouldn't call him a duelist.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:33.080
However, for a dog in a position of 
authority, he accepts it when he loses.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:41.210
So it's a special pursuit deck.  
What an interesting creation.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.310
Recently in Neo Domino 
City, there have been many

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:49.310
cases of people misusing 
D-Wheels and driving wildly.

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:54.890
To oppose them, a mobile squad known 
as the Duel Chasers has been formed.

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.220
That is the deck specially 
customized for their use.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.590
And you're giving it to me?

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:03.540
I heard that you recently lost to a D-Wheeler

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:07.540
and paid for the stolen item 
out of your own salary.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:10.980
That is the moral code of a duelist.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:14.680
It turned out fine because they accepted it.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.300
But before you're a duelist, 
you're a Security agent.

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:22.140
Understood.  But the next time I meet him,

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:26.140
things will end up differently 
because I now have this.

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:32.420
If that D-Wheel shows up again, tell me!

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.910
I wonder what the expression 
on Jack's face will be.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.110
Are you going to duel Jack?

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.220
I'll make him give me back 
the card.  That's all.

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.710
That card belongs to all of us.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.220
You're right.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.780
Every one of us wanted to meet that dragon.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:03.260
The Riding Duel that Yusei showed us when 
he hacked into the City was amazing.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:09.250
We learned that in the City, the Duel Disk 
was developed further into the D-Wheel.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:15.390
We were all deeply moved when 
Yusei created the D-Wheel.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:30.090
When that dragon flew, I was 
trembling with excitement.

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.920
Our dreams came true.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:41.520
However, Jack was already planning 
to steal Yusei's D-Wheel and card.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.010
This D-Wheel is also incredible.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.940
It can go through that 
pipeline in two minutes.

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.370
In only two minutes?  Is that true?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.050
I ran a simulation.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.980
You hacked them again?

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.870
Security's network isn't guarded well.

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:14.070
Once a month at midnight, the 
pipeline is stopped for maintenance.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.010
It takes three minutes for the automatic

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:21.010
maintenance to finish before 
garbage starts flowing again.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:27.410
If I can get through the maintenance hatch 
before then, I can escape to the outside.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:32.210
Yusei, you're…

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:37.530
No, I won't say anything anymore.  
I'll pray for your success.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.560
We found you.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.290
We've come to give you our thanks.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:51.850
Due to the commotion this 
afternoon, we were punished!

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:54.430
Furthermore, they docked our pay!

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:59.150
We really wanted to thank you.

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.350
Is that a D-Wheel?

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.730
This doesn't concern you.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.750
It's a waste for a D-Wheel to be in the 
possession of a bunch of Satellite punks.

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:13.090
That treasure is going to waste.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.540
We can't let it go to waste.

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.990
Give it to me and I'll forget 
about the trouble you caused.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.350
I refuse.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:27.880
Oh, so you're the D-Wheeler?

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.560
Do you know how to duel?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.550
Or do you want me to teach you?

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:36.360
How about you wager that D-Wheel?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:43.730
Yusei, don't battle him.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.010
Yusei!

00:11:52.620 --> 00:11:54.350
Moment out.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.040
A hybrid.

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:04.420
Yusei, we don't have time for this!

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:08.650
They mocked our dream.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.540
Dream?  Don't you realize you're 
just a bunch of Satellite losers?

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:16.340
Come, over here.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:23.890
Duel!

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.240
Duel!

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:44.410
I'm going to go first!  I draw!

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:48.200
From my hand, I summon Chainsaw Insect!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:54.220
It's only Level 4 but has 2400 attack points?

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:57.080
He's applying pressure 
from the very beginning.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:13:02.460
Then I activate the Continuous 
Spell Retribution of the Antlion!

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:10.330
When a monster is destroyed and sent to the 
graveyard, the controller takes 800 points of damage!

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.780
That means…

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:16.820
When either Yusei or his monster is 
destroyed, it takes away life points.

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:19.680
It's a spell that's very 
risky even to himself.

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.490
It means that he's very confident.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:25.520
I end my turn.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:31.630
I'll show you how scary 
my Power Insect Deck is.

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:34.290
Uryu, you're the best!

00:13:37.270 --> 00:13:38.720
My turn.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:43.030
From my hand, I summon Shield 
Warrior in defense position.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.090
Then I set one card and end my turn.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:55.010
You chicken.  You pathetically 
placed it in defense position.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.470
It makes me laugh!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.030
Then it's my turn!

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.240
I summon Pinch Hopper!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:12.430
Then I send one Insect-Type monster in my 
hand to the graveyard to activate Insect Costume!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.030
Showtime is about to start!

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:21.050
Due to the effect of Insect Costume, I 
add one Insect-Type monster to my hand!

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:26.950
Afterwards, one Insect-Type monster 
on the field is destroyed!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.580
He destroyed his own monster?

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:39.450
Why did my life points decrease?

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:44.080
C'mon now.  It's due to the effect 
of your own Continuous Spell.

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:47.380
Oh yeah!  You're right!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:51.810
However, that didn't hurt me at all!  Watch!

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:55.220
Pinch Hopper's effect now activates!

00:14:55.220 --> 00:15:03.440
When this card is sent to the graveyard, I can 
Special Summon one Insect-Type monster from my hand.

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.340
Metal Armored Bug!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.540
It has 2800 attack points!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:12.980
Even though I suffered the effect 
of Retribution of the Antlion,

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:14.980
it's worth it because I 
summoned a powerful monster!

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:17.040
It's profiting from loss!

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:19.500
It's huge!

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.360
He's brought out another incredible monster.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:24.110
In order to take advantage 
of Pinch Hopper's effect,

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:27.110
he intentionally destroyed 
it using Insect Costume.

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:30.810
I'm not done!  The fun is only beginning!

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:34.830
I remove two Insect-Type cards 
in my graveyard from play.

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:39.950
This allows me to Special Summon 
Doom Dozer from my hand!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:44.260
The insect monster army 
is now going to battle!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:49.700
First, Chainsaw Insect 
attacks Shield Warrior!

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:54.250
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:03.560
This can negate your monster's 
attack once a turn.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:07.180
Then Scrap-Iron Scarecrow is once again set.

00:16:09.150 --> 00:16:13.430
You survived the first one, 
but I have two more remaining!

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:17.740
Metal Armored Bug, attack Shield Warrior!

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.150
Shield Warrior…

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:28.880
Here it comes!

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:34.580
Due to the effect of the Continuous Spell 
Retribution of the Antlion, you lose life points!

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.860
Doom Dozer, attack him directly!

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:46.010
Yusei!

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.970
This is bad.  Yusei's life points 
have decreased in an instant.

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:56.140
Impressive, Uryu!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.750
How's that!  Try to counterattack me!

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:07.680
My turn.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:11.620
From my hand, I summon Speed Warrior.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:18.100
Then from my hand, I activate 
the spell card Double Summon.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:27.850
Due to this effect, I can 
Normal Summon again this turn.

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.310
I'll use this card.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:34.420
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron!

00:17:34.420 --> 00:17:36.790
It's here!  It's Junk Synchron!

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.540
Junk Synchron tunes Speed Warrior!

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.400
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:56.180
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:59.240
Synchro Summon!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.760
Come, Junk Warrior!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:04.910
What?

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:09.110
What's with him?  He can do Synchro Summons?

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:13.250
It's nothing to worry about, Uryu!  
You still have a huge lead!

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:19.840
Then from my hand, I activate 
the Equip Spell Fighting Spirit!

00:18:21.610 --> 00:18:27.570
For every monster that you have, Junk 
Warrior's attack points increase by 300 points!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:32.430
The opponent has three monsters!  It 
increases by a total of 900 points!

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:34.280
Incredible, Yusei!

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:42.040
What?  It's stronger than the 
power of my insect monster army!

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.830
Is this really possible?

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.750
Then I activate the Continuous 
Spell Domino Effect.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:51.500
Domino Effect?  What's that?

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:55.350
Junk Warrior attacks Chainsaw Insect!

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.210
Scrap Fist!

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:04.810
Then…

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:10.880
I send the two cards Scrap-Iron Scarecrow 
and Fighting Spirit to the graveyard.

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:14.440
Now this is the Domino Effect.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:31.770
With Domino Effect, when a monster on your 
field is destroyed and sent to the graveyard,

00:19:32.210 --> 00:19:38.690
for every card on my field that I send to 
the graveyard, one of your monsters is destroyed.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:43.020
I see!  By sending two cards 
to the graveyard, Doom Dozer

00:19:43.020 --> 00:19:47.020
and Metal Armored Bug were 
destroyed due to Domino Effect!

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:54.260
Now take the effect of your own 
Retribution of the Antlion.

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.470
Alright!

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.350
Yusei won!

00:20:06.440 --> 00:20:09.010
No way…

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:15.720
A long time ago, my friend told me something.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.990
In a duel, you can't win just with monsters.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:25.130
You can't win with just 
traps or spells either.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:29.410
The true meaning appears 
when everything becomes one.

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:36.790
And the most important thing you need 
to achieve victory is right here.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.980
My friend didn't tell me what it was.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:43.440
But I know.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:48.020
It's the soul of a duelist that 
believes in all his cards!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.300
Well said.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.760
Sorry to bother you.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.940
But this isn't the end.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:00.430
Next time, I'll win!

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.210
Fine.

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.420
Do you need anything?

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:31.910
When I arrived in this city…

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:35.790
It was on a moonlit night like this.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:09.690
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:15.100
We’ll step forward and find out

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:21.040
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:26.280
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:29.450
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:35.020
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:42.190
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:47.600
And I’ll someday pass them to you

00:22:48.030 --> 00:22:53.540
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:58.780
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:04.920
I’ll dash and acquire 
all the bright futures

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:14.330
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
